<objective>
Implement the `sablonRouter` (CRUD with sidecar variable extraction) at `lib/trpc/routers/sablon.ts` and register it in `lib/trpc/routers/_app.ts`. The router consumes the schema (Plan 01), the sidecar handler (Plan 02), and the upload route's response shape (Plan 03), wiring them into the four CRUD procedures the UI (Plan 05) will call.

Purpose: This is the wiring plan — connects all backend pieces. Per SABLON-05 deletes cascade as SET NULL; per SABLON-06 overwrite preserves DB id; per RESEARCH path-traversal must be guarded on every disk operation.

Output: Working router + appRouter registration + integration test that verifies SET NULL FK behavior end-to-end.
</objective>

