<threat_model>
## Trust Boundaries

| Boundary | Description |
|----------|-------------|
| Authenticated tRPC client → router | input crosses zod boundary; ad/kategori user-controlled |
| Router → sidecar | file_path passed to Python via JSON IPC |
| Router → filesystem | unlink operations on dosya_yolu values pulled from DB |
| Router → DB | drizzle queries with parameterized values (zod-validated) |

## STRIDE Threat Register

| Threat ID | Category | Component | Disposition | Mitigation Plan |
|-----------|----------|-----------|-------------|-----------------|
| T-16-15 | Spoofing | Unauthenticated CRUD calls | mitigate | Every procedure uses `protectedProcedure` (matches all existing v1.0/v1.1 routers); `publicProcedure` not used anywhere in this router |
| T-16-16 | Tampering | kategori value injection beyond enum | mitigate | sablonCreateSchema.kategori is `z.enum(SABLON_KATEGORILER)` — non-enum values rejected at validation; DB CHECK constraint (Plan 01) is defense in depth |
| T-16-17 | Tampering | filePath injection pointing outside uploads/templates/ | mitigate | `safeUnlink` verifies `path.resolve(filePath).startsWith(TEMPLATES_BASE_PATH)` before any unlink; rejects + logs traversal attempts |
| T-16-18 | Repudiation | Delete operations not auditable | accept | Phase 16 does not include olay_gunlugu writes for sablon CRUD (out of phase scope per ROADMAP); Phase 18 adds belge-level audit, sablon-level audit deferred |
| T-16-19 | Information Disclosure | Sidecar error messages reflected back to client | accept | Sidecar errors are Turkish strings authored by us in Plan 02; no stack traces or file paths leaked |
| T-16-20 | Denial of Service | Sidecar hang during extract-vars (no timeout in router) | accept | runSidecarCommand from Phase 15 owns timeout/retry policy; this router relies on that contract |
| T-16-21 | Elevation of Privilege | TRPCError code mismatch lets unauthorized clients infer existence | accept | NOT_FOUND vs BAD_REQUEST distinction is acceptable for an authenticated single-user app per PROJECT.md |
| T-16-22 | Tampering | Race between create's sidecar call and parallel delete | accept | Single-user offline app; concurrent CRUD on same template id from one user is non-realistic |
</threat_model>

